{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21967","headline":"纳粟 · 白居易","name":"纳粟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有吏夜叩门，高声催纳粟。\n家人不待晓，场上张灯烛。\n扬簸净如珠，一车三十斛。\n犹忧纳不中，鞭责及僮仆。\n昔余谬从事，内媿才不足。\n连授四命官，坐尸十年禄。\n常闻古人语，损益周必复。\n今日谅甘心，还他太仓谷。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21967.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21967","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}